# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in. Vite loads .env.local automatically.

# Groq API key for Whisper large-v3 transcription (used by the Waiata
# Try-singing button). Sign up at https://console.groq.com/keys.
#
# NOTE: any VITE_-prefixed variable is bundled into the client at build
# time, so this key WILL be visible to anyone who inspects the deployed
# JavaScript. That is acceptable for a classroom prototype but must be
# replaced with a small backend proxy (Cloudflare Worker, Vercel
# Function, ...) before any real deployment.
VITE_GROQ_API_KEY=

# DeepSeek API key — used ONLY by the Purākau module (Step 3) to warmly rephrase
# the pre-written, teacher-approved hint when a child taps the wrong taonga.
# Output is tightly constrained (grounded by the approved hint, no free-text
# input, no invented cultural content) and always falls back to the curated hint
# on any error/timeout/missing key. Get a key at https://platform.deepseek.com.
# Same VITE_ caveat as above: bundled into the client; use a proxy for real
# deployments. (If DeepSeek blocks browser CORS, the curated hint is used.)
VITE_DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=
